/**
 * @file SimulationFixedLagSmoother.cpp
 * @brief Fixed-lag smoother for INS/GNSS/PARS simulation data.
 *
 * Reads simulation CSV data (generated by MATLAB) and runs a fixed-lag
 * smoother with CombinedImuFactor, GPSFactor, and PARS (range/azimuth/
 * elevation) factors. Templated on:
 *   - BIAS:      imuBias::ConstantBias | imuBias::GaussMarkovBias
 *   - UseSE23:   false -> legacy NavState-based CombinedImuFactor on
 *                         (Pose3, Vector3, BIAS)
 *                true  -> SE_2(3) CombinedImuFactor2 on (ExtendedPose3, BIAS)
 *
 * Output CSVs get an `_se23` suffix when UseSE23 is true.
 */

